{"seq":19,"slug":"information-retrieval","title":"信息检索","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":6,"docCount":18,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 信息检索 简介\n\n信息检索是计算机科学中研究如何从大规模文档集合中高效获取用户所需信息的经典学科。从早期的图书馆编目系统到现代搜索引擎，信息检索理论和技术经历了数十年的发展，形成了一套完整的理论体系和工程方法。作为搜索引擎、问答系统和推荐系统的基础学科，掌握信息检索原理对于理解现代信息系统至关重要。\n\n本知识库面向有一定编程和数学基础的中高级工程师，适合从事搜索引擎、文本处理、自然语言处理等方向的技术人员。读者应了解基本的概率论和线性代数知识。\n\n全书分为四章，系统覆盖信息检索的核心理论与方法：\n\n第一章**信息检索基础**介绍信息检索的基本概念、发展历程和布尔检索模型、向量空间模型等经典方法。第二章**索引与检索模型**深入讲解倒排索引数据结构、概率检索模型和语言模型方法。第三章**文本处理与分析**涵盖分词、词干提取和 TF-IDF 权重计算等文本预处理技术。第四章**评估指标与方法**系统介绍精确率、召回率、MAP、NDCG 等评估体系。\n\n建议读者按章节顺序学习，先建立概念框架，再深入检索模型，然后掌握文本处理技术，最后通过评估方法论完成知识闭环。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-fundamentals","title":"信息检索基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-overview","title":"信息检索概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-fundamentals/ir-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"boolean-model","title":"布尔检索模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-fundamentals/boolean-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-space-model","title":"向量空间模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-fundamentals/vector-space-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"indexing-models","title":"索引与检索模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inverted-index","title":"倒排索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/inverted-index"},{"seq":2,"slug":"probabilistic-models","title":"概率检索模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/probabilistic-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-models","title":"语言模型检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/language-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"query-evaluation","title":"查询评价与处理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/query-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-metrics","title":"IR 评价指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/query-evaluation/ir-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-processing","title":"查询处理与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/query-evaluation/query-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trec-methodology","title":"TREC 与评测方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/query-evaluation/trec-methodology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标与方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"precision-recall","title":"精确率与召回率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/precision-recall"},{"seq":2,"slug":"map-ndcg","title":"MAP 与 NDCG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/map-ndcg"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-methodology","title":"评估方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/evaluation-methodology"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"text-processing","title":"文本处理与分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/text-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenization-normalization","title":"分词与归一化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/text-processing/tokenization-normalization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stemming-lemmatization","title":"词干提取与词形还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/text-processing/stemming-lemmatization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tfidf-weighting","title":"TF-IDF 权重计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/text-processing/tfidf-weighting"}]},{"seq":6,"